# Modular monolith

Follow [docs/architecture/modular-architecture.md](docs/architecture/modular-architecture.md) and [docs/architecture/overview.md](docs/architecture/overview.md). Do not paste them.

- Dependency direction: `app → modules → shared`.
- Modules never import `app`. Shared never imports modules or `app`.
- Cross-module use only `public.ts`, `server.ts`, or `client.ts`.
- Do not mix server and client exports in one barrel.
- Privileged code stays server-only. Route files stay thin adapters.
- Do not invent modules from schema tables or Spotify feature lists. Discover capabilities from implemented workflows.
- Playlist tables are unclaimed until a playlist workflow exists.
